Package: PhysioIO
Title: Input and Output Functions for 'PhysioExperiment' Objects
Version: 0.2.4
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides input and output capabilities for
    'SummarizedExperiment'-derived physiological signal containers.
    Supported formats include 'EDF' and 'EDF+', 'BDF', 'GDF',
    'BrainVision', 'HDF5', 'BIDS', comma-separated values, and 'MATLAB'
    files, together with 'DuckDB' database integration. Out-of-memory
    processing of large datasets is available through delayed 'HDF5'
    arrays.
biocViews: Software, Infrastructure, DataImport, DataRepresentation
